<section class="ev-cs"><div class="ev-cs-inner"><h2>Wat maakt Eveom™ anders</h2><ul class="ev-cs-list"><li>Gebouwd voor uitgebreid dagelijks welzijn</li><li>Zichtbare resultaten in weken, niet maanden</li><li>Langdurige cellulaire bescherming</li><li>Schone, hoogwaardige formule</li></ul><a href="#" class="ev-cs-btn" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});return false;">PROBEER RISICOVRIJ VANDAAG</a><p class="ev-cs-badge">90-dagen niet-goed-geld-terug-garantie</p></div></section><style>.ev-cs{padding:60px 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;background:#243918;text-align:center}.ev-cs-inner{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto}.ev-cs h2{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 24px}.ev-cs-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 32px;text-align:left;display:inline-block}.ev-cs-list li{padding:8px 0 8px 28px;position:relative;font-size:16px;color:#fff;line-height:1.6}.ev-cs-list li::before{content:"\2713";position:absolute;left:0;color:#8bc34a;font-weight:700}.ev-cs-btn{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#243918;padding:16px 40px;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.5px;transition:opacity .2s}.ev-cs-btn:hover{opacity:0.9}.ev-cs-badge{color:#fff;font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 0;opacity:0.8}</style>

